t-heading elementskit-section-title-wraper text_left   ekit_heading_tablet-   ekit_heading_mobile-\"><h2 class=\"ekit-heading--title elementskit-section-title \">Privacy <span><span>Policy<\/span><\/span><\/h2><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-544ed46 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"544ed46\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b56551b e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"b56551b\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div data-particle_enable=\"false\" data-particle-mobile-disabled=\"false\" class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-58ad3d7 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"58ad3d7\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-cf6f6cf elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"cf6f6cf\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Exo 2&quot;, Arial, Tahoma, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\">We respect the privacy of those who visit our web site. In accordance with this, we have created this policy in order to demonstrate our privacy commitment to our users:<\/p><h3 class=\"h2-custom\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 26px; line-height: 27px; font-family: &quot;Exo 2&quot;, Arial, Tahoma, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\">What this Privacy Policy Covers<\/h3><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Exo 2&quot;, Arial, Tahoma, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\">This Privacy Policy covers our treatment of personally identifiable information that we collect when you are on our site, and when you use our services. This policy also covers our treatment of any personally identifiable information that third parties share with us.<\/p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Exo 2&quot;, Arial, Tahoma, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\">This policy does not apply to the practices of organizations that we do not own or control, or to people that we do not employ or manage.<\/p><h3 class=\"h2-custom\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 26px; line-height: 27px; font-family: &quot;Exo 2&quot;, Arial, Tahoma, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\">Information Collection and Use<\/h3><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Exo 2&quot;, Arial, Tahoma, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\">We collect personally identifiable information when you register on our website, when you use our services, and when you visit our pages. We may also receive personally identifiable information from third parties.<\/p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Exo 2&quot;, Arial, Tahoma, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\">When you register with us, we ask for your name, email address, zip code, occupation, industry, and personal interests. Once you register with us and sign in to our services, you are not anonymous to us.We use this information for three general purposes: to customize the content you see, to fulfill your requests for certain services, and to contact you about services.<\/p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Exo 2&quot;, Arial, Tahoma, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\">We also automatically receive and record information on our server logs from your browser including your IP address, cookie information and the page you requested. This information is not linked to your account and will not be used to identify you.<\/p><h3 class=\"h2-custom\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 26px; line-height: 27px; font-family: &quot;Exo 2&quot;, Arial, Tahoma, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\">Information Sharing and Disclosure<\/h3><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Exo 2&quot;, Arial, Tahoma, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\">We will not sell or rent your personally identifiable information to anyone.<\/p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Exo 2&quot;, Arial, Tahoma, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\">We will send personally identifiable information about you to other companies or people when<\/p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Exo 2&quot;, Arial, Tahoma, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\">We have your consent to share the information;<\/p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Exo 2&quot;, Arial, Tahoma, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\">We respond to subpoenas, court orders or legal process; or<\/p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Exo 2&quot;, Arial, Tahoma, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\">We find that your actions on our web sites violate the Terms of Service<\/p><h3 class=\"h2-custom\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-weight: 700; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 26px; line-height: 27px; font-family: &quot;Exo 2&quot;, Arial, Tahoma, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(68, 68, 68); text-transform: none; background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\">Changes to this Privacy Policy<\/h3><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Exo 2&quot;, Arial, Tahoma, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\">The privacy policy is subject to modification from time to time. If we decide to change our privacy policy, we will post those changes here so that you will always know what information we gather, how we might use that information and whether we will disclose it to anyone. Any significant changes to our privacy policy will be announced on our home page. If you do not agree with the changes in our policy you can simply discontinue to visit our website.<\/p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Exo 2&quot;, Arial, Tahoma, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\">Questions or Suggestions<\/p><p style=\"margin: 0px 0px 15px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; font-variant-numeric: inherit; font-variant-east-asian: inherit; font-stretch: inherit; font-size: 14px; line-height: inherit; font-family: &quot;Exo 2&quot;, Arial, Tahoma, sans-serif; vertical-align: baseline; color: rgb(98, 98, 98); background-color: rgb(252, 252, 252);\">If you have questions or suggestions send an email to us.<\/p><div class=\"column mcb-column one column_column column-margin-\"><div class=\"column_attr clearfix\">\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Privacy Policy We respect the privacy of those who visit our web site. In accordance with this, we have created this policy in order to demonstrate our privacy commitment to our users: What this Privacy Policy Covers This Privacy Policy covers our treatment of personally identifiable information that we collect when you are on our [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"elementor_header_footer","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-3524","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"acf":[],"aioseo_notices":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/3524","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=3524"}],"version-history":[{"count":13,"href":"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/3524\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":4337,"href":"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/3524\/revisions\/4337"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.jaipuriaschoolpadrauna.in\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=3524"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":tru